# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# This project runs in Docker / on a Linux VPS, so LF everywhere avoids
# CRLF issues (and shebang scripts staying executable as expected).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types — never normalize or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
